[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0273","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0273.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0473","title":"Mutt 邮件客户端 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mutt 邮件客户端在 1.2.5 版本前处理 IMAP 协议响应时存在格式化字符串漏洞，未正确验证服务器返回的格式化字符串参数。攻击者可搭建恶意 IMAP 服务器，诱导受害者使用受影响版本的 Mutt 连接并接收邮件，通过精心构造的格式化字符串载荷覆盖栈内存中的函数指针或返回地址，实现远程任意代码执行。漏洞影响所有运行 Mutt < 1.2.5 的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击者无需认证即可在用户查收邮件时触发漏洞，完全控制受害主机、窃取邮件数据或植入恶意软件。建议立即升级至 Mutt 1.2.5 或更高版本，或暂时禁用 IMAP 功能并限制非受信 IMAP 服务器访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0473"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 Mutt 到 1.2.5 或更高版本（如当前稳定版 2.2.12）。若无法立即升级，可临时禁用 IMAP 功能或仅连接受信 IMAP 服务器，并在防火墙层面限制非信任 IMAP 服务器的 143/993 端口访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0246.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000385","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98473109630421&w=2","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-031.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/5615","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-029.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6235","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0473.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0473","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0473.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/69057bcb6031b1cea28108d52631b2209d46077a/data/2001/CVE-2001-0473.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-69cf-v4wg-q552/GHSA-69cf-v4wg-q552.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a6b3bb4e-ccf5-4499-84fa-6eaeaa54aeff.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-031.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0473.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--a6b3bb4e-ccf5-4499-84fa-6eaeaa54aeff.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0271","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0271.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0441","title":"slrn 新闻阅读器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"slrn 新闻阅读器 0.9.7.0 之前版本中的 wrapping 和 unwrapping 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的长消息头触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 slrn 0.9.7.0 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。用户应升级至 0.9.7.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0441"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:18Z","remediation":"升级 slrn 至 0.9.7.0 及以上版本。Debian 2.2 (potato) 用户可更新至 slrn_0.9.6.2-9potato1，通过 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade slrn 完成安装。如无法升级，建议禁用 slrn 的自动消息头解析功能，或限制 slrn 仅处理可信新闻组来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2001-04/0610.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000383","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98471253131191&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-040","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-028.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-028.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2493","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6213","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0441.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0441.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0441","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0441.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0441.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-040.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-269v-f6q7-wg8w/GHSA-269v-f6q7-wg8w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-040.data","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/16ff6b12ac6524d13f757f6247b06fcf708b8bcd/2001/CVE-2001-0441.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0271.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0266","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0266.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0417","title":"MIT Kerberos 4 符号链接攻击任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Kerberos 4 (krb4) 认证协议在创建新的票据文件时存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在系统临时目录中预先创建指向目标文件的符号链接，诱使 krb4 服务在写入新票据时覆盖任意文件，导致系统文件完整性受损。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，影响范围包括使用 krb4 协议的系统。由于需要本地访问权限，实际危害相对有限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0417"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Kerberos 5 (krb5) 替代已停止维护的 krb4，krb5 已修复票据文件的符号链接竞争条件。如无法升级，确保 krb4 票据目录 `/tmp` 使用粘滞位 (chmod +t /tmp)，并限制本地非授权用户登录系统以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0078.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-025.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0417.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0417","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0417.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0417.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-84hw-m4f3-jqjx/GHSA-84hw-m4f3-jqjx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88946/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0417.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8b5a33a2-19a7-49d2-bec0-5207721ca0fa.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0266.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0264","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0264.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0416","title":"sgml-tools 临时文件权限不当致信息泄露漏洞","description":"sgml-tools（又称 sgmltools）1.0.9-15 之前版本在处理文档时创建临时文件使用了不安全的权限设置，导致本地攻击者可利用该漏洞读取正在被 sgml-tools 处理的文件内容，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需特殊权限，只需在系统本地能够访问临时目录即可实施攻击。该漏洞影响 Linux 等 Unix 类系统上使用 sgml-tools 的所有版本，危害等级低，CVSS 评分 2.1。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0416"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16Z","remediation":"升级 sgml-tools 至 1.0.9-15 或更高版本。Debian 用户可通过 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade sgml-tools 命令更新。该版本修复了临时文件权限不安全的问题，确保处理中的文件不会被其他用户读取。如无法立即升级，可限制本地非信任用户登录系统作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000390","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98477491130367&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-038","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-030.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_016_sgmltool_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-027.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2506","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2683","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6201","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0416.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0416","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0416.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0416.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-038.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jrxx-vxgm-j5r5/GHSA-jrxx-vxgm-j5r5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-038.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6637e84f-76b2-4c80-93f3-13d6d6ef605b.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2008/deb_038_1.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0264.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0254","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0254.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0381","title":"OpenPGP PGP 加密私钥文件篡改致私钥泄露漏洞","description":"OpenPGP 标准在处理加密私钥文件时存在密码分析攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过修改目标用户的加密私钥文件，并捕获一条使用该私钥签名的消息，利用密码分析手段推导出私钥签名密钥。成功利用此漏洞可导致签名密钥泄露，进而伪造签名或解密加密信息。该漏洞影响所有遵循 OpenPGP 标准的实现，攻击者需具备本地文件修改权限，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0381"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:12Z","remediation":"升级 GnuPG 至 2.0 或更高版本（当前最新为 2.5.x），该漏洞已在 OpenPGP 标准后续修订（RFC 4880）及现代实现中修复。如使用商业 PGP 产品，联系厂商获取安全更新。无法升级时，避免在不可信环境中存储加密私钥文件，并限制对私钥文件的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0252.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0274.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0311.html","http://www.osvdb.org/11966","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-063.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2673","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6558","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0381.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0381","https://github.com/rundeck/rundeck/blob/71798e610acc1c798869a9e263c84b49a79869a5/cve-suppress.xml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0381.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0381.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jg9x-x4x8-whvw/GHSA-jg9x-x4x8-whvw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9c0ca478-d4ff-472f-a332-e576edc41aa4.json","https://github.com/futehkao/elements/blob/e580e21e1fdad77e7156df255eb1134eae436ea9/owasp.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0254.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0252","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0252.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0328","title":"HP Tru64 UNIX TCP/IP 初始序列号预测拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP Tru64 UNIX TCP/IP 协议栈在生成初始序列号（ISN）时使用随机增量算法，导致序列号可预测性增加。远程未认证攻击者可向目标系统发送大量包含不同 ISN 值的数据包洪水，其中某个数据包的 ISN 可能匹配目标 TCP 连接预期的序列号，从而实现会话劫持或导致 TCP 连接中断拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 HP Tru64 UNIX 系统的 TCP/IP 协议栈，攻击者无需认证即可远程发起攻击，攻击复杂度低，主要造成可用性影响（CVSS 5.0，AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于拒绝服务类漏洞。HP 已发布补丁 PHNE_26771 和 PHNE_26101 修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0328"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:06Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 HP 官方补丁 PHNE_26771 (针对 HP-UX 11.00) 和 PHNE_26101 (针对 HP-UX 10.20)，或升级至 HP Tru64 UNIX V5.1A 及以上版本。若无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙配置入口过滤规则阻止伪造源 IP 的 TCP 数据包，并启用 TCP 序列号随机化内核参数（如 HP-UX 的 tcp_seq_randomness=1）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/8044","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/57","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-09.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2682","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033181","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A4922","https://support.f5.com/csp/article/K19063943?utm_source=f5support&amp%3Butm_medium=RSS","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0328.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0328.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0328","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2001-0328.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2001-0328-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0328.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0328.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jvrp-wcjq-4xx5/GHSA-jvrp-wcjq-4xx5.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/hpux_PHNE_26771.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/hpux_PHNE_26101.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0252.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0198","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0495","title":"DataWizard WebXQ 2.1.204 目录遍历漏洞","description":"DataWizard WebXQ 服务器 1.204 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中插入 `../` 序列绕过路径限制，读取 Web 根目录以外的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需身份认证，仅需向目标服务器发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发，利用门槛极低。该漏洞影响 DataWizard WebXQ 1.204 及更早版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0495"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:24Z","remediation":"DataWizard WebXQ 1.204 已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即迁移至现代受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache httpd、Nginx）。在迁移完成前，部署反向代理（如 Nginx）过滤 URL 中的 `../` 及 `..\\` 目录遍历序列，并配置 WAF 规则拦截路径穿越攻击。同时限制 Web 服务运行账户的文件系统权限，避免敏感目录可被读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0490.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1799","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2660","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6466","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20807","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0495.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0495","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0495.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0495.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c7rf-c8f3-mrwv/GHSA-c7rf-c8f3-mrwv.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0495.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--233b9ef8-7b2b-4390-87db-f080f1fd5e07.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--233b9ef8-7b2b-4390-87db-f080f1fd5e07.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0197","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0197.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0491","title":"RaidenFTPD Server 2.1 目录遍历漏洞","description":"RaidenFTPD Server 2.1 build 952 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务发送特制的包含多个点号（如 CWD 命令中的 \"....\"、NLST 命令中的 \"..\" 或 \"...\"）的路径遍历请求，绕过 FTP 根目录限制，访问服务器文件系统上的任意文件。该漏洞仅影响机密性，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0491"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:24Z","remediation":"升级 RaidenFTPd 至 build 952 或更高版本，该版本修复了 CWD/NLST 命令中的目录遍历缺陷。如无法升级，在 FTP 服务器配置中限制用户目录访问权限，禁用匿名用户写入权限，并在防火墙或 WAF 层过滤包含连续点号（如 `..`、`....`）的 FTP 命令路径参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0465.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6455","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20803","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0491.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0491","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0491.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0491.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5prc-wx72-q987/GHSA-5prc-wx72-q987.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/raidenftpd_dir_traversal.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0491.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dirtra.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0197.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0196","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0490","title":"NullSoft Winamp AIP 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NullSoft Winamp 2.6x 及 2.7x 版本在处理 AIP 文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含超长字符串的恶意 AIP 文件并诱导用户打开，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 Winamp 多媒体播放器的广泛用户群体，可能导致攻击者完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0490"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:24Z","remediation":"升级到 Winamp 2.80 及以上版本，该版本已修复 AIP 文件解析中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，避免打开来源不明的 .aip 文件，并在邮件网关和下载服务器层面拦截 .aip 后缀文件。鉴于 Winamp 已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的媒体播放器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0518.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20820","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0490.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0490","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0490.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0490.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jvcm-f82v-38gx/GHSA-jvcm-f82v-38gx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83011/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0490.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--42cba1da-25d7-456e-8d19-690530f1135f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0196.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0194","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0194.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0485","title":"SGI IRIX netprint 任意共享库加载本地权限提升漏洞","description":"IRIX 操作系统中的 netprint 工具存在任意共享库加载漏洞，具有 lp 组权限的本地攻击者可通过 -n 选项指定恶意共享库文件，导致以 lp 权限执行任意命令，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 IRIX 5.3、6.2、6.3、6.4、6.5 及 6.5.11 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需先获得 lp 组访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0485"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:23Z","remediation":"立即应用 SGI 官方安全公告 20010701-01-P 提供的补丁，升级 netprint 组件。如无法打补丁，可移除 netprint 的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/lib/print/netprint），并禁用 lp 默认无密码账户（passwd -l lp）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0475.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0502.html","http://www.osvdb.org/8571","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2656","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6473","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20804"