ed":"2026-06-16T21:54:23Z","remediation":"将 Tektronix PhaserLink 850 打印机置于受信任的内部网络，在防火墙上限制对 80/443 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许管理员的特定 IP 连接。禁用不必要的 Web 管理功能（如 _ncl_subjects.shtml 和 _ncl_items.shtml）。如设备固件有更新，升级到最新版本。对于已停产无法更新的设备，建议隔离到独立管理 VLAN 或替换为支持认证的新型号打印机。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0482.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6482","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20806","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0484.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0484","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0484.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0484.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-65x5-3mwx-8fmv/GHSA-65x5-3mwx-8fmv.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0484.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/ncl_items_2.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--49d5604e-b1dc-4da4-964b-aa9a06ec85d9.json","https://github.com/InfoSecWarrior/Vulnerable-Box-Resources/blob/c784bcf63e1ec5c3a0116043d8653d00f0a21a0b/Vulnhub/OZ/oz-1-nikto-80-output.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0193.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0192","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0192.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0476","title":"SWSoft ASPSeek s.cgi 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SWSoft ASPSeek 搜索引擎 1.03 及更早版本中的 s.cgi 程序存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 HTTP 查询字符串或超长 tmpl 参数，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 ASPSeek 1.03 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，可导致信息泄露、权限提升及服务被完全控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0476"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 ASPSeek 至 1.0.4 或更高版本（官方补丁已发布于 http://www.aspseek.org/changes.html）。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至现代搜索引擎替代方案。临时缓解措施：移除或限制 Web 服务器上 s.cgi 脚本的执行权限，在 Web 服务器配置中禁止对 /cgi-bin/s.cgi 的访问，并过滤超长 HTTP 查询字符串。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0233.html","http://www.aspseek.org/changes.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2492","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6248","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20689","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0476.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0476","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0476.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0476.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x95q-59mj-wfrx/GHSA-x95q-59mj-wfrx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a1aa4b96-df3a-425a-8c6e-bdd04e60a275.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0192.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0192.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0192.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0191","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0191.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0471","title":"SSH 守护程序登录失败未记录日志漏洞","description":"SSH-1（SSHD-1）守护进程 1.2.30 及更早版本存在日志记录缺失漏洞。该守护程序未能记录重复的登录尝试行为，导致远程攻击者可通过暴力破解方式对 SSH 服务进行密码猜测攻击而不会被系统日志检测到。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，成功后可获取目标系统的未授权访问权限，进而完全控制受影响主机。该漏洞影响所有运行 SSH-1 1.2.30 及更早版本的系统，攻击条件低，仅需网络可达即可发起攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0471"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:22Z","remediation":"升级 SSH 服务端至 1.2.31 或更高版本，该版本已修复登录失败日志记录缺失问题。强烈建议弃用已过时的 SSH-1 协议，迁移至 OpenSSH 并仅启用 SSH-2 协议（在 sshd_config 中设置 Protocol 2），同时配置 fail2ban 等工具对多次认证失败来源 IP 进行自动封禁，以增强暴力破解攻击的检测与防御能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/160648","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2345","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20615","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0471.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0471","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0471.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0471.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_bruteforce.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0471.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6e202fba-8e6a-4d04-b75f-5af496c60629.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2345/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0191.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0190","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0190.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0468","title":"FTPFS mount 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FTPFS 是一款用于挂载 FTP 目录的文件系统工具，其 0.1.1/0.2.1/0.2.2 版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 mount 命令传递超长用户名参数触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用此漏洞可获得 root 权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响系统完整性与可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0468"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:21Z","remediation":"立即卸载 FTPFS 内核模块（`rmmod ftpfs`），并删除或重命名模块文件（如 `/lib/modules/$(uname -r)/kernel/fs/ftpfs/ftpfs.o`）防止自动加载。该模块已长期无人维护，建议迁移至基于 FUSE 的现代替代方案（如 curlftpfs）替代 FTPFS 的全部功能。同时限制普通用户对 mount 命令的执行权限，移除 `/etc/fstab` 中所有 ftpfs 类型的挂载条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0163.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6234","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20691","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0468.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0468","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0468.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0468.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6378-v25v-557w/GHSA-6378-v25v-557w.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82997/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0468.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0190.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0189","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0189.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0467","title":"RobTex Viking Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"RobTex Viking Web Server 1.0.7 及之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在 HTTP URL 请求中使用经过特殊构造的 `\\...`（反斜杠加多个点）序列绕过路径限制，可读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 RobTex Viking Server 1.07-381 之前的所有版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0467"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:21Z","remediation":"The user wants me to generate a `[remediation]` field for CVE-2001-0467. This is a directory traversal vulnerability in RobTex Viking Web server before version 1.07-381. The vulnerability allows remote attackers to read arbitrary files via a `\\...` (modified dot dot) in an HTTP URL request.\n\nI need to provide a Chinese remediation suggestion with ≥20 characters, specific actionable steps. Since this is an old vulnerability (2001), the product is likely discontinued. I should provide practical remediation steps.\n\nLet me think about what would be appropriate:\n1. Upgrade to version 1.07-381 or later\n2. If the product is no longer supported, consider migrating to a modern web server\n3. As a mitigation, use URL filtering or WAF rules to block directory traversal patterns\n\nLet me write a concise, actionable remediation inChinese.<value>立即升级 RobTex Viking Server 至 1.07-381 或更高版本以修复目录遍历漏洞。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache 或 Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器。临时缓解措施可在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截包含 `\\...` 模式的 HTTP 请求。\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.robtex.com/files/viking/beta/chglog.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/178935","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2643","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6450","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20793","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0467.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0467","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0467.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0467.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7w2x-4jg9-m554/GHSA-7w2x-4jg9-m554.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/2